sources in health</article-title><source>Human Resources for Health</source><year>2003</year><volume>1</volume><fpage>9</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14613523</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1478-4491-1-9</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>World Bank</collab></person-group><source>Indonesia's Health Work Force: Issues and Options World Bank Report No 12835-IND, 12835-IND ed Washington DC</source><year>1994</year></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Martinez</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Martineau</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Rethinking human resources: an agenda for the millennium</article-title><source>Health Policy Plan</source><year>1998</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>345</fpage><lpage>348</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10346027</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/heapol/13.4.345</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kluyskens</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><source>Assessment of Regulatory Responsibilities and Management of Health Work Force Mission Report</source><year>2007</year><publisher-name>Jakarta: World Bank</publisher-name></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>